eter-Pillars orchestra."},{"p":85,"b":8,"s":"MR. PILLARS","x":"Well that's -- Hudson joined the band just a little bit later."},{"p":85,"b":9,"s":"MR.","x":"Is that George Hudson?"},{"p":85,"b":10,"s":"MR. PILLARS","x":"George Hudson."},{"p":85,"b":11,"s":"MR.","x":"Okay."},{"p":85,"b":12,"s":"MR. PILLARS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":85,"b":13,"s":"MR.","x":"But, then this statement isn't really accurate, that the band was organized in Cleveland?"},{"p":85,"b":14,"s":"MR. PILLARS","x":"IN Cleveland, Ohio."},{"p":85,"b":15,"s":"MR.","x":"Right. You moved to St. Louis?"},{"p":85,"b":16,"s":"MR. PILLARS","x":"Moved to St. Louis."},{"p":85,"b":17,"s":"MR.","x":"Okay. And Hudson joined the band later?"},{"p":85,"b":18,"s":"MR. PILLARS","x":"Hudson joined the band a few weeks"},{"p":86,"b":0,"s":"MR. PILLARS","x":"later."},{"p":86,"b":1,"s":"MR.","x":"Okay. Yeah."},{"p":86,"b":2,"s":"MR. PILLARS","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":86,"b":3,"s":"MR.","x":"All right."}]}